Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]   Configuration related keywords for feature CB009915-B4-IWK13 with µDTX
...               Prerequisite : commissioning is managed automatically and basic_setup.cfg must be properly configured
...               Scope : keywords for sub-feature
...               Configuration done via json delta files:
...               Cell 1 is configred with 18 blanked PRBs low
...               Cell 2 is configured with 34 blanked PRBs low and 14 blanked PRBs high
...               2 UEs are performing small end bursty traffic, UE1 on cell 1, UE2 on cell2
...               At first configuration the µDTX threshold is set with dtxPrbThreshold = 13 for cell 1 and 15 for cell 2
...               with these values and the trafic generated, taking into account the blanked PRB, all ues reach the thhreshold.
...               This is checked with python on tti trace.
...               Then the threshold is modified to 14 for cell 1 and 16 for cell 2.
...               At this time it is verifed that blanking is achieved as configured (no prb used in blanked area)
...               The threshold is no more reached. (again checked with tti and python KW.
...               Then PM are verified to check that DTX is used.
#
...               Test Case Scenario author   :
...               Creation Date               : 2023-12-01
...               Modified Date               : 2024-03-27
#
...               Last Modified by            : loic.marzin@nokia.com
...                                             StartTTILogs moved after CellSetup or else OAM ErrorCode69
...               Version    Date      Author                                Notes
...               0.1        FB2324    Axel Gouilly-Frossard                 Creation robot based on CB9915-A

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Resource                                        ./CB009915-Common-Keywords.robot
Library                                         ../python/CB009915-B-4-DTX_checkTTItrace.py
#Library                                         Dialogs

*** Variables ***
${scf_delta_config_9915_DTX_initial}         testsuite/Paris/RRM/ET/CB009915/resources/config/Delta_scf_CB009915_B4_DTX-initial.json
${scf_delta_config_9915_DTX_NewThreshold}    testsuite/Paris/RRM/ET/CB009915/resources/config/Delta_scf_CB009915_B4_DTX-NewThreshold.json
${gnb_alias}                                 gnb_under_test
${cb009915_B4_DTX_constraints}          testsuite/Paris/RRM/ET/CB009915/resources/config/CB009915_B4_DTX_constraints.csv

#&{dlData_csiRsSendReq_check_9915_A}             subcellid=0    sfn=0    slot=0    rnti=0    startPrb=0    numOfPrb=0    trsInfo=0

# coresetDomainFreq definition for nrcell 1:
# 2305840810190438400 => 1FFF FE00 0000 0000 => 0001 1111 1111 1111 1111 1110 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000
# 20 bits are set to 1 (20* 6 PRBs) then 120 PRBs are used for coreset and, 120 is the size defined for the coresetDedicated of this cell
${coresetFreqDomain_9915_B4_C1}                2305840810190438400

# coresetDomainFreq definition for nrcell 2:
# 288230101273804800 => 03FF FFC0 0000 0000 => 0000 0011 1111 1111 1111 1111 1100 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000
# 20 bits are set to 1 (20* 6 PRBs) then 120 PRBs are used for coreset and, 120 is the size defined for the coresetDedicated of this cell
${coresetFreqDomain_9915_B4_C2}                288230101273804800

&{dlData_pdcchSendReq_coresetFreqDomain_check_9915_B4}    subcellid=0    sfn=0    slot=0    rnti=0    startCce=0    coresetFreqDomain=0

&{dlData_pdschSendReq_check_9915_B4}             subcellid=0    sfn=0    slot=0    rnti=0    startPrb=0    numOfPrb=0    rbgSize=0    rbgSizeFirst=0
...                                             mcs=0    numOfLayers=0

#&{ulData_prachReceiveReq_check_9915_A}          subcellid=0    sfn=0    slot=0    rnti=0    prachPrbOffset=0

#vbo#not used#&{ulData_pucchReceiveReq_check_9915_A}        subcellid=0    sfn=0    slot=0    rnti=0    pucchFormat=0    numOfLayers=0    startPrb=0
#vbo#not used#...                                             numOfPrb=0

&{ulData_puschReceiveReq_check_9915_B4}          subcellid=0    sfn=0    slot=0    rnti=0    startPrb=0    numOfPrb=0    mcs=0    numOfLayers=0
...                                             pairedUe=0

#vbo#not used#&{ulData_srsReceiveReq_check_9915_A}            subcellid=0    sfn=0    slot=0    rnti=0    startPrb=0

